param PAT p1.scale unit=choice choice=Major|Dorian|Phrygian|Lydian|Mixolydian|Minor|Locrian|Harmonic Minor|Melodic Minor|Harmonic Major|Dorian #4 (Romanian Minor)|Phrygian Dominant|Lydian Dominant|Altered|Lydian Augmented|Locrian Natural 2|Major Pentatonic|Minor Pentatonic|Egyptian|Blues|Major Blues|Man Gong|Hirajoshi|In Sen|Iwato|Kumoi|Yo|Hungarian Minor|Hungarian Major|Double Harmonic (Bhairav)|Neapolitan Major|Neapolitan Minor|Persian|Enigmatic|Spanish 8-Tone|Todi|Marwa|Purvi|Whole Tone|Diminished (W-H)|Diminished (H-W)|Augmented|Prometheus|Bebop Dominant|Bebop Major|Chromatic
